keywords:
  - off-policy evaluation
  - network management
  - handover control
  - deployment safety
  - concentration inequalities
  - confidence sequences
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, derived per-replicate records and figure sources for a study of
  the validity of high-confidence off-policy certificates used to screen handover
  control policies in radio access networks, evaluated on two public 4G and 5G
  measurement corpora.
